  ac/id: string (required)
  ac/product_truth: array (optional)
  Schema: [ac](config/ac_store_schema.json)
Produces:
  SOURCE-REVIEWED DOCUMENTATION: Source-reviewed top-level contract of docs/product-truth/scripts/product_truth_outcome.py::_print_outcome_contract. Additive fields and nested source-defined diagnostic objects remain permitted. This documentation schema is not runtime enforcement or automatic source-code parity. Early dependency/tighten failures do not emit this shape.
  validation_outcome/outcome: string (required)
